          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "stationnement is built on stationner 'to park' with -ment. Stationner comes from station, a learned borrowing from Latin statiō 'a standing', from stāre 'to stand' (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
